### Get all players
GET http://localhost:8080/api/players

### Get player by username
GET http://localhost:8080/api/players/username/john_doe

### Get player by email
GET http://localhost:8080/api/players/email/jane@example.com

### Update player
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/players/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john_updated",
  "email": "john_new@example.com",
  "password": "newsecret"
}

### Delete player by username
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/players/username/alex_wong

### Delete player by ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/players/4